{"seq":2,"slug":"multi-currency-account-balance","title":"多币种账户与余额","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/double-entry-ledger-platform/account-chart-model/multi-currency-account-balance","wordCount":2153,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"多币种账户与余额\">多币种账户与余额</h1><p>汇率是账本里唯一会&quot;无中生有&quot;产生损益的东西。一个跨境平台持有美元、欧元、日元余额，本位币是人民币，那么只要月末汇率变了，即便一笔业务都没发生，账面上的本位币金额也会变化，这部分差额必须被记成损益而不是凭空调整。要让这件事可算，账户模型就必须同时存两套金额：<strong>原币金额</strong>（transaction currency）与<strong>本位币金额</strong>（functional currency）。只存一套的系统，重估时只能反算，误差会累积到无法审计。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-为什么必须双金额\">核心概念：为什么必须双金额</h2><p>假设 1 月 1 日入账 100 万美元，汇率 7.10，本位币记 710 万元。1 月 31 日汇率变 7.05。若账户只存原币 100 万，则报表需要&quot;用当前汇率乘一下&quot;得到 705 万——但这会同时改变 1 月已关账期间的报表数字，等于篡改了历史。存入双金额后，1 月的分录里本位币写死 710 万，2 月做重估时再生成一笔差额分录把本位币调整到 705 万，历史期间的数字纹丝不动。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  T[业务发生&lt;br/&gt;原币 100 USD] --&gt; R{记账汇率来源}&#10;  R --&gt;|入账日汇率| L1[分录行&lt;br/&gt;orig_amount=10000, func_amount=71000]&#10;  R --&gt;|期末日汇率| RE[重估分录&lt;br/&gt;func_amount 差额 -500]&#10;  L1 --&gt; B[账户余额&lt;br/&gt;orig=10000 USD&lt;br/&gt;func=71000 CNY]&#10;  RE --&gt; B&#10;  B --&gt; TB[试算平衡&lt;br/&gt;按币种分组]\">graph TD\n  T[业务发生&lt;br/&gt;原币 100 USD] --&gt; R{记账汇率来源}\n  R --&gt;|入账日汇率| L1[分录行&lt;br/&gt;orig_amount=10000, func_amount=71000]\n  R --&gt;|期末日汇率| RE[重估分录&lt;br/&gt;func_amount 差额 -500]\n  L1 --&gt; B[账户余额&lt;br/&gt;orig=10000 USD&lt;br/&gt;func=71000 CNY]\n  RE --&gt; B\n  B --&gt; TB[试算平衡&lt;br/&gt;按币种分组]</pre><p>工程上关键的一点是：<strong>原币与本位币是在分录行上同时落库的</strong>，而不是在分录头上。原因是一笔分录可能涉及多个不同的原币账户（比如用美元户付欧元户），每个行的原币不同，本位币由各自的原币乘入账汇率得来。把汇率放在分录头只能表达单一币种，会限制账本的表达能力。</p>\n<h3 id=\"双金额下余额的读法与写法\">双金额下余额的读法与写法</h3><p>双金额带来的一个直接后果是：<strong>余额也必须是双份的</strong>，且两份各自独立累加、不允许互相推导。读余额时，原币金额与本位币金额是两列，业务按需取用——展示给用户看的是原币，做财务汇总和试算平衡的是本位币。写余额时，两者在同一条 UPDATE 里一起变，不能只更新一列：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"UPDATE account_balance&#10;   SET posted_orig = posted_orig + :orig_delta,&#10;       posted_func = posted_func + :func_delta,&#10;       version     = version + 1&#10; WHERE account_id = :account_id;&#10;-- 注意 func_delta 由 orig_delta 乘入账汇率得来，不是在读余额时反算\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> account_balance</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   SET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> posted_orig </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> posted_orig </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :orig_delta,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       posted_func </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> posted_func </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :func_delta,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">     =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> account_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :account_id;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 注意 func_delta 由 orig_delta 乘入账汇率得来，不是在读余额时反算</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>func_delta</code> 必须由分录行上的 <code>func_amount</code> 直接提供，而不是在更新余额时&quot;用当前汇率算一下&quot;。后者会让余额里的本位币金额随汇率漂移，且与分录行上的金额不一致——那就同时破坏了可审计性与试算平衡。</p>\n<h2 id=\"账户的币种策略\">账户的币种策略</h2><h3 id=\"一账户一币种是默认选择\">一账户一币种是默认选择</h3><p>有两种设计：<strong>一账户一币种</strong>与<strong>一账户多币种</strong>。实务上几乎总是选前者，理由如下表。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>一账户一币种</th>\n<th>一账户多币种</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>平衡校验</td>\n<td>天然按币种分组，简单</td>\n<td>需按币种维度拆开，复杂度上行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>余额唯一性</td>\n<td><code>(account_id)</code> 唯一</td>\n<td><code>(account_id, currency)</code> 唯一</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>余额查询</td>\n<td>单行读取</td>\n<td>需按币种聚合或多行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>透支与限额控制</td>\n<td>单币种限额直接可比</td>\n<td>需折算后比较，引入汇率风险</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>汇率处理</td>\n<td>只在本位币金额上</td>\n<td>每币种各一套</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>新建币种成本</td>\n<td>建新账户</td>\n<td>同一账户加一行余额</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一账户一币种把&quot;币种&quot;提升成账户身份的一部分，让唯一约束、索引、并发控制都保持单维度。多币种账户的唯一收益是&quot;用户只有一个钱包号&quot;这类外在体验，而这个体验完全可以在应用层用一个 <code>wallet_id → [account_id]</code> 的映射实现，不必污染账本内核。推荐：<strong>账本层一账户一币种，展示层做聚合</strong>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"账户与余额表的-ddl\">账户与余额表的 DDL</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE account (&#10;  account_id     VARCHAR(40) PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  coa_code       VARCHAR(32)  NOT NULL REFERENCES chart_of_accounts(code),&#10;  owner_type     VARCHAR(16)  NOT NULL&#10;                 CHECK (owner_type IN (&#39;USER&#39;,&#39;MERCHANT&#39;,&#39;PLATFORM&#39;,&#39;CHANNEL&#39;)),&#10;  owner_id       VARCHAR(64)  NOT NULL,&#10;  currency       CHAR(3)      NOT NULL,&#10;  allow_negative BOOLEAN      NOT NULL DEFAULT FALSE,&#10;  opened_at      TIMESTAMPTZ  NOT NULL DEFAULT now()&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE TABLE account_balance (&#10;  account_id     VARCHAR(40)  PRIMARY KEY REFERENCES account(account_id),&#10;  currency       CHAR(3)      NOT NULL,&#10;  posted_orig    BIGINT       NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,&#10;  posted_func    BIGINT       NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,&#10;  frozen_orig    BIGINT       NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,&#10;  version        BIGINT       NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,&#10;  updated_at     TIMESTAMPTZ  NOT NULL DEFAULT now()&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE UNIQUE INDEX uq_account_owner&#10;  ON account(coa_code, owner_type, owner_id, currency);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> account</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  account_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">40</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  coa_code       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> chart_of_accounts(code),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  owner_type     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                 CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (owner_type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'USER'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'MERCHANT'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'PLATFORM'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CHANNEL'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  owner_id       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  currency       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  allow_negative </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BOOLEAN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> FALSE,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  opened_at      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> account_balance</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  account_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">40</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> account(account_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  currency       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  posted_orig    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  posted_func    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  frozen_orig    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  updated_at     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> UNIQUE INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> uq_account_owner</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> account(coa_code, owner_type, owner_id, currency);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>uq_account_owner</code> 这条唯一索引防的是一类具体事故：并发开户请求导致同一商户出现两个&quot;应付商户款-USD&quot;户，资金被拆到两处，试算平衡时两边都平，但对账时怎么都对不上。唯一索引让第二个请求直接失败，比事后合并安全得多。</p>\n<h2 id=\"余额的四个维度\">余额的四个维度</h2><h3 id=\"posted-权威-其余派生\">posted 权威、其余派生</h3><p>一个只存&quot;余额&quot;的账户不够用，因为业务需要区分&quot;钱到账了没有&quot;和&quot;钱能不能动&quot;。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>语义</th>\n<th>典型来源</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>已记账余额 <code>posted</code></td>\n<td>分录累计额，权威值</td>\n<td>所有已过账分录之和</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>冻结余额 <code>frozen</code></td>\n<td>已占用但尚未扣减</td>\n<td>提现申请、预授权</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可用余额 <code>available</code></td>\n<td><code>posted - frozen</code>，派生值</td>\n<td>计算得出，不落库或落库并校验</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>透支上限 <code>overdraft</code></td>\n<td>允许的负值下限</td>\n<td>商户授信额度</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这里有一条必须守住的规则：<strong><code>posted</code> 是权威，其余都是派生</strong>。<code>available</code> 可以落库做性能优化，但必须能在任意时刻由 <code>posted - frozen</code> 复算并且相等；一旦两者允许不等，就再也说不清哪个是对的。冻结余额属于&quot;占位&quot;而非&quot;记账&quot;，因此它的增减不产生分录，但必须与分录在同一事务里更新，否则会出现&quot;钱扣了但冻结没释放&quot;的挂账。</p>\n<h3 id=\"并发扣减必须一条-sql-完成\">并发扣减必须一条 SQL 完成</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 原子扣减可用余额：乐观锁 + 条件更新，绝不用 SELECT 再 UPDATE&#10;UPDATE account_balance&#10;   SET posted_orig = posted_orig - 10000,&#10;       version     = version + 1,&#10;       updated_at  = now()&#10; WHERE account_id = &#39;ACC_USER_WALLET_9001&#39;&#10;   AND allow_negative_false_safe;  -- 见下方说明\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 原子扣减可用余额：乐观锁 + 条件更新，绝不用 SELECT 再 UPDATE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> account_balance</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   SET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> posted_orig </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> posted_orig </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">     =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       updated_at  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> account_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ACC_USER_WALLET_9001'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> allow_negative_false_safe;  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 见下方说明</span></span></code></pre></div><p>上面这条语句是反面示例——<code>allow_negative_false_safe</code> 不存在。正确写法需要一个额外的守卫条件，把&quot;不允许透支&quot;编进 <code>WHERE</code>，让数据库用行锁原子地完成判断与更新：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"UPDATE account_balance b&#10;   SET posted_orig = b.posted_orig - 10000,&#10;       version     = b.version + 1,&#10;       updated_at  = now()&#10;  FROM account a&#10; WHERE b.account_id = a.account_id&#10;   AND b.account_id = &#39;ACC_USER_WALLET_9001&#39;&#10;   AND (a.allow_negative OR b.posted_orig - b.frozen_orig &gt;= 10000);&#10;-- 受影响行数 = 0 表示余额不足，应用层据此拒绝，而不是先查后改\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> account_balance b</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   SET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> posted_orig </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">posted_orig</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">     =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       updated_at  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> account a</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">account_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">account_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">account_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ACC_USER_WALLET_9001'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">allow_negative</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> OR</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">posted_orig</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">frozen_orig</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 受影响行数 = 0 表示余额不足，应用层据此拒绝，而不是先查后改</span></span></code></pre></div><p>关键是&quot;判断&quot;与&quot;更新&quot;在同一条语句里由数据库在行锁下完成。任何 <code>SELECT balance</code> 再 <code>UPDATE</code> 的两步写法，在并发下都会丢更新：两个请求都读到 100，都判断够，都扣 100，最终余额 -100 而预期是 0。这类 bug 在压测下才暴露，上生产后表现为&quot;偶发透支&quot;，极难复现。注意余额更新本身不替代分录——按账本的不可变原则，余额是分录的聚合，这两条路径必须要么都走要么都不走，具体见 <a href=\"../balance-trial-balance/balance-snapshot-carryforward\">余额快照与结转</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"汇率与金额精度\">汇率与金额精度</h2><h3 id=\"金额与汇率的存储形式\">金额与汇率的存储形式</h3><p>三个精度问题必须一次定对，事后改动会波及全部历史数据。</p>\n<p><strong>金额用整数最小单位。</strong> 人民币用分，日元用元（日元无小数），部分币种有 3 位小数（如科威特第纳尔）。用浮点或 <code>DECIMAL</code> 在跨语言序列化时会引入精度问题，最稳的做法是统一存 <code>BIGINT</code> 的最小单位，币种的小数位数单独存一张 <code>currency_meta</code> 表。</p>\n<p><strong>汇率用定点数且位数固定。</strong> 汇率不要用浮点。常见做法是存 <code>DECIMAL(20,10)</code> 或放大成整数（如汇率 × 10^10）。汇率精度决定折算误差的下限：假设汇率精度 8 位，一笔 10 亿元的交易折算误差可达 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>9</mn></msup><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></msup><mo>×</mo><mtext>汇率</mtext><mo>≈</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^9 \\times 10^{-8} \\times \\text{汇率} \\approx</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8974em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">9</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8974em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">8</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">汇率</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span></span></span></span></span> 数元级别，对账时会出现无法解释的几分钱差额。</p>\n<p><strong>折算方向必须唯一。</strong> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 为&quot;1 单位原币 = <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 单位本位币&quot;，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>func_amount</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>round</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>orig_amount</mtext><mo>×</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></msup></mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>o</mi></msub></msup></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{func\\_amount} = \\text{round}\\left(\\frac{\\text{orig\\_amount} \\times r \\times 10^{d_f}}{10^{d_o}}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">func_amount</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4991em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">round</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5491em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7751em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">orig_amount</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2901em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>o</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_o</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 分别是原币与本位币的小数位数。方向的唯一性比公式本身更重要——同一笔业务在不同模块用了互为倒数的两个汇率，是差额最常见的来源。</p>\n<h3 id=\"币种元数据表\">币种元数据表</h3><p>把小数位数与折算规则集中在元数据表里，避免散落在各处的 <code>if currency === &#39;JPY&#39;</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE currency_meta (&#10;  currency      CHAR(3)      PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  minor_digits  SMALLINT     NOT NULL,  -- 0=JPY, 2=CNY/USD, 3=KWD&#10;  is_functional BOOLEAN      NOT NULL DEFAULT FALSE,&#10;  display_name  VARCHAR(64)  NOT NULL&#10;);&#10;&#10;INSERT INTO currency_meta VALUES&#10;  (&#39;CNY&#39;, 2, TRUE,  &#39;人民币&#39;),&#10;  (&#39;USD&#39;, 2, FALSE, &#39;美元&#39;),&#10;  (&#39;JPY&#39;, 0, FALSE, &#39;日元&#39;),&#10;  (&#39;KWD&#39;, 3, FALSE, &#39;科威特第纳尔&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> currency_meta</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  currency      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  minor_digits  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SMALLINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">     NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 0=JPY, 2=CNY/USD, 3=KWD</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  is_functional </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BOOLEAN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> FALSE,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  display_name  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> currency_meta </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VALUES</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CNY'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, TRUE,  </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'人民币'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'USD'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, FALSE, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'美元'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'JPY'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, FALSE, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'日元'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'KWD'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, FALSE, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'科威特第纳尔'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>is_functional</code> 标记本位币，全表只允许一行为真——这条约束让&quot;哪套金额用于报表汇总&quot;成为数据而非代码里的常量。</p>\n<p>关于汇率从哪来（入账日汇率、期末汇率、即期汇率）以及重估如何生成损益分录，见 <a href=\"../balance-trial-balance/period-revalue-fx\">期末重估与汇兑损益</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>多币种账本的核心是把&quot;币种&quot;提升为账户的第一类身份，并把原币、本位币两套金额同时落在分录行上。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>一账户一币种</strong>是默认选择，多币种账户把复杂度推给了平衡校验、余额唯一性和限额控制，收益可以用应用层映射替代。</li>\n<li><strong>原币与本位币双金额写在分录行上</strong>，因为一笔分录的不同行可以是不同币种。</li>\n<li><strong><code>posted</code> 是权威余额，<code>available</code>/<code>frozen</code> 是派生</strong>，派生值必须可复算且与权威一致。</li>\n<li><strong>余额扣减的判定与更新必须在同一条 SQL 里</strong>完成，两步写法在并发下必然丢更新。</li>\n<li><strong>金额存整数最小单位，汇率存定点数</strong>，折算方向在全系统必须唯一，否则差额无法归因。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>账户结构确定后，剩下的结构问题是账户之间的关系与归属：父子汇总、主体隔离、权限边界，见 <a href=\"account-hierarchy-ownership\">账户层级与归属</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"多币种账户与余额","id":"多币种账户与余额"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：为什么必须双金额","id":"核心概念-为什么必须双金额"},{"level":3,"text":"双金额下余额的读法与写法","id":"双金额下余额的读法与写法"},{"level":2,"text":"账户的币种策略","id":"账户的币种策略"},{"level":3,"text":"一账户一币种是默认选择","id":"一账户一币种是默认选择"},{"level":3,"text":"账户与余额表的 DDL","id":"账户与余额表的-ddl"},{"level":2,"text":"余额的四个维度","id":"余额的四个维度"},{"level":3,"text":"posted 权威、其余派生","id":"posted-权威-其余派生"},{"level":3,"text":"并发扣减必须一条 SQL 完成","id":"并发扣减必须一条-sql-完成"},{"level":2,"text":"汇率与金额精度","id":"汇率与金额精度"},{"level":3,"text":"金额与汇率的存储形式","id":"金额与汇率的存储形式"},{"level":3,"text":"币种元数据表","id":"币种元数据表"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"内部账户与科目体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/double-entry-ledger-platform/account-chart-model/internal-account-chart"},"next":{"title":"账户层级与归属","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/double-entry-ledger-platform/account-chart-model/account-hierarchy-ownership"}}